{"id":"n15746-1-6","stage":2,"title":"빗 · 梳子","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15746-1-6-1","ko":"얘야, 거울 좀 보렴. 머리가 엉망이구나.","zh":"孩子，看看镜子吧。你的头发乱糟糟的哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얘야,","meaning":"“이 아이(这孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"얘：“이 아이(这孩子)”的缩略语。；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"얘","audio":"/audio/1ad358ceb1fa5d832807.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67258","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얘야","audio":"/audio/b841046bdd22c12eff10.mp3"}},{"text":"거울","meaning":"镜子","explanation":"거울：镜子","readings":[{"term":"거울","audio":"/audio/d30e5128c801fcdbc729.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59325","senseId":"1","lemma":"거울","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거울","audio":"/audio/d30e5128c801fcdbc729.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"보렴.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보렴","audio":"/audio/65472a08976eb419cdec.mp3"}},{"text":"머리가","meaning":"头发","explanation":"머리：头发；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"3","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리가","audio":"/audio/9318933bae4caa2e24ff.mp3"}},{"text":"엉망이구나.","meaning":"杂乱，混杂","explanation":"엉망：杂乱，混杂；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"엉망","audio":"/audio/ff4e0c9a8436a25a7ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15195","senseId":"1","lemma":"엉망","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엉망이구나","audio":"/audio/3b79e85c1b103816216a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1ad358ceb1fa5d83","term":"얘","zh":"“이 아이(这孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/1ad358ceb1fa5d832807.mp3","entryId":"67258","definition":"“이 아이(这孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"d30e5128c801fcdb","term":"거울","zh":"镜子","audio":"/audio/d30e5128c801fcdbc729.mp3","entryId":"59325","definition":"可以照出物体样子的薄而平的物品。","pronunciation":["거울"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头发","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"生长在头上的毛发。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"ff4e0c9a8436a25a","term":"엉망","zh":"杂乱，混杂","audio":"/audio/ff4e0c9a8436a25a7ba5.mp3","entryId":"15195","definition":"某东西、场所或氛围等乱糟糟或复杂的状态。","pronunciation":["엉망"]}],"audio":"/audio/6f9a347a0b3dda2ebb13.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15746-1-6-2","ko":"알아요. 그런데 빗이 아무리 찾아도 안 보여요.","zh":"我知道啦。可是不管怎么找，都找不到梳子啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알아요.","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아요","audio":"/audio/680caaa5f15236526b32.mp3"}},{"text":"그런데","meaning":"可是，可","explanation":"그런데：可是，可","readings":[{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70717","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}},{"text":"빗이","meaning":"梳子","explanation":"빗：梳子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"빗","audio":"/audio/576bff5a900abce71921.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15746","senseId":"1","lemma":"빗","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빗이","audio":"/audio/ef65354efb0de75f9bcf.mp3"}},{"text":"아무리","meaning":"多么","explanation":"아무리：多么","readings":[{"term":"아무리","audio":"/audio/c434dbfc17cbdbf0157a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71338","senseId":"2","lemma":"아무리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무리","audio":"/audio/c434dbfc17cbdbf0157a.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아도","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아도","audio":"/audio/d2b08db177ad04356bb5.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"보여요.","meaning":"看得见（안 보이다：看不见、找不到）","explanation":"보이다：看得见（안 보이다：看不见、找不到）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"1","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보여요","audio":"/audio/5b18fa3288f20c8fbb5d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"30c94182141ace2f","term":"그런데","zh":"可是，可","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3","entryId":"70717","definition":"用于将话题与前面内容相连接的同时，又将话头转向其他方向。","pronunciation":["그런데"]},{"id":"576bff5a900abce7","term":"빗","zh":"梳子","audio":"/audio/576bff5a900abce71921.mp3","entryId":"15746","definition":"用于将头发梳理齐整的东西。","pronunciation":["빋"]},{"id":"c434dbfc17cbdbf0","term":"아무리","zh":"多么","audio":"/audio/c434dbfc17cbdbf0157a.mp3","entryId":"71338","definition":"虽然如此也。","pronunciation":["아ː무리"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物或为了见某人而四处查找；或指得到此物或见此人。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看得见（안 보이다：看不见、找不到）","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"看得见（안 보이다：看不见、找不到）","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e7b46873db03839e615e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.417,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15746","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1423,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我知道啦。可是不管怎么找，都找不到梳子啊。","孩子，看看镜子吧。你的头发乱糟糟的哦。","您女儿又高又漂亮。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["孩子，看看镜子吧。你的头发乱糟糟的哦。","您女儿又高又漂亮。","我知道啦。可是不管怎么找，都找不到梳子啊。"],"answer":2}]}
